# P45 on GtkBackend on macOS (TEST_BACKEND=gtk4): seed the sibling state, then press the Binding(get:set:) toggle that keeps the invariant; the siblings must survive.
# Measured 2026-10-16 from p45-macos-gtk4-final-20261016-020011.png (1520x1296, 2x, halved; origin=frame, 28 pt native title bar). The AppKit file's seed clicks at y 482 landed above the seed buttons (y 494-527) on GTK's taller layout (gtk4-aim-20261016.csv2).
# Centres: stateToggle (77,231), honest (63,301), stubborn (69,371), flip honest (74,441), selection = 2 (74,511), typed = seeded (204,511).
# After this file honest must read true, setter writes 1, selection 2 and typed seeded.
# macOS 上 GtkBackend 的 P45:兩個 seed 點擊重新瞄準 y 511;之後 selection 2、typed seeded 必須保留。
sleep,,,,,,1500000,let P45 render,macos
click,74,511,frame,left,,,"seed the sibling selection -- the line must read selection: 2; re-aimed from (64,482), above the button",macos
sleep,,,,,,400000,,macos
click,204,511,frame,left,,,"seed the sibling field -- the line must read typed: seeded; re-aimed from (179,482), above the button",macos
sleep,,,,,,400000,,macos
click,63,301,frame,left,,,"the Binding(get:set:) toggle that keeps the invariant (honest, y 285-317; centred from (54,314), which landed). Expected: honest true, setter writes 1, selection stays 2 with typed still seeded. If the siblings reset, the report is a framework bug",macos
sleep,,,,,,1200000,let any rebuild settle,macos
